# Methods-based Paper

This project involved creating polarizable forcefield parameters for a lipid (triacylglycerol) and benchmarking it against other forcefields using molecular dynamics simulations.

##Overview

The work focused on triacylglycerol models, comparing polarizable and additive force fields, and evaluating surface properties and interfacial behavior.

